Constraints.Constraint:
EVENT BUS IS NOT RPC. A PRE-DISPATCH REQUEST DECISION MUST USE AN EXPLICIT
REQUEST/RESULT OR HOOK/INTERCEPTION CONTRACT WITH DEADLINE AND CANCELLATION;
AN EVENT SUBSCRIBER MUST NEVER DETERMINE WHETHER THE REQUEST CONTINUES.

Assumptions.Assumption:
The first proving consumer needs only deterministic allow/block matching;
adoption of an established production filter engine or full external list
format can be selected in a later change using measured evidence.
